    "section": "8.32",
    "heading": "Climbing",
    "lineStart": 12958,
    "lineEnd": 12962
  },
  "section": "8.32",
  "rulesText": "While you're climbing, each foot of movement costs 1 extra foot (2 extra feet in Difficult Terrain). You ignore this extra cost if you have a Climb Speed and use it to climb.\n\nAt the GM's option, climbing a slippery surface or one with few handholds might require a successful DC 15 Strength (Athletics) check."
}
